      "x": 881.1667199670046,
      "y": 2238.5833599835028,
      "width": 732.5194702148438,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 137113073,
      "version": 468,
      "versionNonce": 1591620049,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793806684176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reaction to the \"SOA\" dream, that ended up as sort of \"microservices\",\nbut all of that became a monolith in the browser.\n\n- Browsers SUCK, and JavaScript is even worse.\n    - it is barely good enough for anything.\n    - don't do really complicated things there\n    - (it doesn't even know what an integer is!)\n\n- Making multiple requests to APIs that had to be in a particular sequence\n    and was having race issues (race conditions).\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reaction to the \"SOA\" dream, that ended up as sort of \"microservices\",\nbut all of that became a monolith in the browser.\n\n- Browsers SUCK, and JavaScript is even worse.\n    - it is barely good enough for anything.\n    - don't do really complicated things there\n    - (it doesn't even know what an integer is!)\n\n- Making multiple requests to APIs that had to be in a particular sequence\n    and was having race issues (race conditions).\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
